# After the login's latch lifts, the entries it held are judged at most this many a minute (land.json
# "resetJudgesPerMinute"; 0 turns the stagger off), the longest due first (judge_order: a PR the cache shows one merge
# away goes ahead of the rest), for LAND_RESET_STAGGER_S after the clear. Only a judgment (land_judge explain: its
